## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical, beginner-friendly automation for common security misconfigurations across accounts, focusing on OpenSearch governance and automated remediation.

## Key Concepts
- AWS Config rules and remediation
- EventBridge for orchestration
- Lambda for automated changes
- IAM SCPs for cross-account guardrails
- OpenSearch domain security settings (public access, encryption)

